assertion = "Require the served 0x1017 contract and its exact address, pack getPoolCount using its own ABI, execute through StaticCallEVM, and require the returned uint256 pool count to be exactly zero; this replaces the stale legacy ABI call while preserving a successful view and exact zero inventory assertion"
